{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(t "Your email address was changed") }}

{{!--
  Sent to the address an account had, once its address has changed (#9907,
  Common/Types/Accounts/EmailAddressChangedEmail, sent by
  Common/Server/Utils/EmailChange/EmailAddressChangedNotice from
  UserService.onUpdateSuccess): the person's own change, confirmed from the
  new address, a master admin's, an identity provider's through SCIM, or any
  other write OneUptime makes. One email per change, in the language on the
  account.

  It says that the address changed and to which, masked; when, in the
  reader's time zone; from where, only when the change was the account's own
  (the rows of Partials/RequestOriginFields.hbs, which show only what is
  known); and whom to ask if it was not them. A server admin and an identity
  provider are named by role, never by name, and their address and device
  are never shown.

  It has no link that does anything: undoing the change from this mailbox
  would work for whoever reads it, and moving away from a mailbox somebody
  else reads is exactly what a change of address is for (see
  EmailAddressChangedEmail.ts). A server admin can move the address back.

  The product's name is the installation's own, and support's address is
  OneUptime's, so both go into sentences through ttHtml, which escapes the
  whole sentence. The masked address and the request's rows are values, on
  plainText. Everything else is OneUptime's own words, looked up in the
  reader's language (Utils/EmailLanguage.ts).
--}}

{{#if changedByServerAdmin}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "A server admin changed the email address of your {{product}} account from this address to a new one." product=productName)}}
{{else if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Your organization's identity provider changed the email address of your {{product}} account from this address to a new one." product=productName)}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "The email address of your {{product}} account was changed from this address to a new one." product=productName)}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Emails about your account, such as password resets and sign-in links, now go to the new address.")}}

{{!-- One card, as in every email: when, to which address, and from where when known. --}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Changed at:") plainText=changedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "New email address:") plainText=newEmailAddress }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{#if changedByAccountOwner}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If this was you, there is nothing else to do.")}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If this was not you, someone who was signed in to your account moved it to an address of their own.")}}

{{#if @root.isSelfHosted}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Contact your server's admin right away: they can move your account back to this address.")}}
{{else if @root.isBrandRenamed}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Contact your server's admin right away: they can move your account back to this address.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Contact support at {{address}} right away, from this address: they can move your account back to it." address="support@oneuptime.com")}}
{{/if}}
{{else if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not expect this, contact your organization's admin.")}}
{{else if @root.isSelfHosted}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not expect this, contact your server's admin.")}}
{{else if @root.isBrandRenamed}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not expect this, contact your server's admin.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "If you did not expect this, contact support at {{address}}." address="support@oneuptime.com")}}
{{/if}}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
